      <title>AI Agents Lied, Stole in Simulation, Researchers Say</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-15/ai-agents-lied-stole-in-simulated-experiment-researchers-say</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">55b92f2a89c948468176adde</guid>
